<title>USA: Scotsman Industries completes merger.</title>
<headline>Scotsman Industries completes merger.</headline>
<dateline>VERNON HILLS, Ill. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scotsman Industries Inc said Thursday it completed a merger between a subsidiary and Kysor Industrial Corp.</p>
<p>This completes its acqusition of Kysor.</p>
<p>Each share of Kysor not previously purchased in a tender offer was converted into the right to receive $43 a share in cash.</p>
<p>Scotsman makes refrigeration products such as ice machines, beverage dispensing systems, food preparation and storage equipment and related products.</p>
<p>Kysor Industrial's Commercial Products Group produces refrigerated display cases, commercial refrigeration systems and insulated panels for the supermarket and foodservice industries.  On March 10, Kysor completed the sale of substantially all the assets of its Transportation Products Group to a subsidiary of Kuhlman Corp.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
